{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","text":"SamplingDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aren’t sampled again.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence, which ends once the tracker has finished and every report has been read. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s is empty."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"title":"samplingDropReports","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamplingDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L391"},"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV19samplingDropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA08SamplingD6ReportVGvp","role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","abstract":[{"text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read.","type":"text"}],"title":"records","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Records","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noOp"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","abstract":[{"text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"empty.","type":"text"}],"title":"noOp"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"title":"Tracker","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}]},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The reports or deliveries a library type makes, in the order it makes them, kept until they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are read; one reader at a time reads them."}],"title":"AsyncQueue"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingDropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SamplingDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"samplingDropReports","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true},{"text":"s dropped, in the order the drops happen.","type":"text"}],"u